{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:26.486979+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the report! It looks like something in `spsolve` fails in the presence of duplicate indices. You can fix the issue in your case by doing this before passing the `I_csr` buffers to `spsolve`:\r\n```python\r\nI_csr = I_csr.sum_duplicates()\r\n```","created_at":"2024-05-03T18:25:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031#issuecomment-2093542256","id":2093542256,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc58yOtw","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2093542256/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-05-03T18:26:29Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2093542256","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I suspect this is working as intended, since `spsolve` is a lower-level function, though we should do a better job of documenting its requirements.","created_at":"2024-05-03T18:27:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031#issuecomment-2093545284","id":2093545284,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc58yPdE","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2093545284/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-05-03T18:27:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2093545284","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Thank you, adding `sum_duplicates` resolved the issue! It would be great if this eventually gets automatically taken care of by Jax so that sparse matrices behaves in the same way as scipy.","created_at":"2024-05-04T20:34:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031#issuecomment-2094372109","id":2094372109,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc581ZUN","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2094372109/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-05-04T20:34:03Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2094372109","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9490185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/buvoli","id":9490185,"login":"buvoli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0OTAxODU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buvoli","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I don't think we'll ever automatically take care of this, because deduplication is a relatively expensive operation (even detecting whether deduplication is necessary is expensive!), and people calling a low-level routine like `spsolve` generally care about performance.","created_at":"2024-05-05T14:23:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031#issuecomment-2094829651","id":2094829651,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21031","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc583JBT","performed_via_github_app":nul